cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use stanworkflow, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "stanworkflow: Declarative Bayesian Workflow for Hand-Written Stan Models"
version: 0.0.0.9000
authors:
  - family-names: Ofir-Geva
    given-names: Shay
    email: shinofir@gmail.com
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-7871-2778"
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
repository-code: "https://github.com/ShayOfir/stanworkflow"
url: "https://github.com/ShayOfir/stanworkflow"
abstract: >-
  An R package that wraps cmdstanr in a declarative compile, prior predictive,
  fit, diagnose and infer pipeline for user-written Stan models, with
  checkpoint/resume and draw-level descriptive, counterfactual and parameter
  contrasts.
keywords:
  - Bayesian workflow
  - Stan
  - cmdstanr
  - R
  - counterfactual contrasts
  - neuroscience
